Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:52:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(auth): sign in with Pubky Ring through a WebAuthn
 passkey request

The page hands Ring a signin_grant request inside a WebAuthn challenge (or an
encrypted PRF mailbox on iOS 18). The browser verifies the origin, Ring checks
cid against it, approves on the relay as usual, and the page adopts the session
only when the passkey's userHandle names the approving pubky.
